e e di desiderio","overview":"Ahmed, 18 anni, francese di origine algerina, è cresciuto nella periferia di Parigi. Sui banchi dell'università incontra Farah, una giovane tunisina piena di energia arrivata da poco a Parigi. Mentre scopre un corpo di letteratura araba sensuale ed erotica di cui non ha mai saputo l'esistenza, Ahmed si innamora profondamente di lei e sebbene letteralmente sopraffatto dal desiderio, cercherà di resistervi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Tale of Love and Desire","overview":"Ahmed, 18, is French of Algerian origin. He grew up in the Parisian suburbs. On the benches of the university, he meets Farah, a young Tunisian full of energy recently arrived from Tunis. While discovering a body of sensual and erotic Arabic literature that he never knew existed, Ahmed falls deeply in love with this girl, and although literally overwhelmed by desire, he will try to resist it."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Ahmed, 18 ans, français d’origine algérienne, a grandi en banlieue parisienne. Sur les bancs de la fac, il rencontre Farah, une jeune Tunisienne pleine d’énergie fraîchement débarquée à Paris. Tout en découvrant un corpus de littérature arabe sensuelle et érotique dont il ne soupçonnait pas l’existence, Ahmed tombe très amoureux de cette fille, et bien que littéralement submergé par le désir, il va tenter d’y résister."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9khBX6FghE7Dw4Y38pbkJRd7tnd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bcm0pfzkZl3K6KHCbpJqmwTM06F.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":820702,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9khBX6FghE7Dw4Y38pbkJRd7tnd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9khBX6FghE7Dw4Y38pbkJRd7tnd.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candida